  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "briefing.exit",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Badge Orth. Foyer at nineteen. Moth eats inconsistencies; feed him boredom. Sera will be there \u2014 race her in competence, not volume. Maris has her own brief. Do not become her obstacle. Go.",
      "tags": [
        "briefing",
        "exit"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "briefed",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "at_reception",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "op": "location",
          "id": "foyer"
        },
        {
          "op": "objective",
          "id": "contact_maris",
          "status": "active",
          "label": "Make contact with Maris Quell"
        },
        {
          "op": "objective",
          "id": "identify_voss",
          "status": "active",
          "label": "Identify Lord Edrin Voss"
        },
        {
          "op": "objective",
          "id": "obtain_fragment",
          "status": "active",
          "label": "Obtain the shipping discrepancy fragment"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Analysis",
          "text": "Sera named early. Rival confirmed. Adjust threat model.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Idealism",
          "text": "She said 'be a person.' Hold her to that when the intel starts winning.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "briefing.intro",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Sit. Leave the chair alone. Tonight you are Cassian Orth: Trade Liaison, logistics analyst, a man who schedules his own pulse. Cover is clean. Your face is not yet.",
      "tags": [
        "briefing",
        "entry",
        "start"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "briefing_started",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "briefing.intro.ready",
          "text": "Parameters. Now.",
          "intent": "professional",
          "next": "briefing.objectives",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "rel",
              "char": "wren_halden",
              "respect": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "briefing.intro.dread",
          "text": "You're going to brief my manners.",
          "intent": "deflect",
          "next": "briefing.objectives",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "rel",
              "char": "wren_halden",
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "set_flag",
              "flag": "dreads_romance_brief",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Insecurity",
          "text": "The chair squeaked. She heard the chair squeak.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Tradecraft",
          "text": "Listen for the objective before she invents feelings as mission parameters.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "briefing.objectives",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Contact Maris Quell \u2014 Observatory Circle, policy, not inventory. Identify what Voss wants from the east-dock schedules. Lift the guest-list cipher from the study annex if you can walk out bored. Maintain Orth. Avoid heat. If you develop feelings, do it after the fragment.",
      "tags": [
        "briefing",
        "objectives"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "obj_contact_maris",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "obj_identify_voss",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "obj_cipher_fragment",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "briefing.obj.ack",
          "text": "Contact. Identify. Retrieve.",
          "intent": "professional",
          "next": "briefing.romance_protocol"
        },
        {
          "id": "briefing.obj.push",
          "text": "Define heat. Then define feelings.",
          "intent": "probe",
          "next": "briefing.romance_protocol",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "rel",
              "char": "wren_halden",
              "respect": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Analysis",
          "text": "Three objectives, one evening, zero spare selves.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Idealism",
          "text": "She said Maris is not a vending machine. Write that down in permanent ink.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "briefing.romance_more",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "One more. Observatory Circle is fighting Voss on dock opacity this week \u2014 real stakes, not small talk. If you open with funding like a questionnaire, she will end you politely. If you open like someone who read page four and cared, she might stay.",
      "tags": [
        "briefing",
        "comedy"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "memory",
          "id": "mem_wren_tariffs",
          "summary": "Wren confirmed tariffs are not charming.",
          "salience": 2,
          "tags": [
            "comedy",
            "advice"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "briefing.romance_more.ok",
          "text": "Dock opacity. Page four. No questionnaire.",
          "intent": "ack",
          "next": "briefing.exit",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "set_flag",
              "flag": "knows_maris_fight",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "op": "memory",
              "id": "mem_wren_opacity",
              "summary": "Wren: Maris/Observatory fighting Voss on dock opacity; don't open like a questionnaire.",
              "salience": 3,
              "tags": [
                "briefing",
                "maris"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "briefing.romance_more.probe",
          "text": "How do you know what she's fighting this week?",
          "intent": "probe",
          "next": "briefing.exit",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "rel",
              "char": "wren_halden",
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "set_flag",
              "flag": "knows_maris_fight",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "op": "memory",
              "id": "mem_wren_opacity",
              "summary": "Wren knows Maris's opacity fight this week \u2014 sources unspecified.",
              "salience": 3,
              "tags": [
                "briefing",
                "maris"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Insecurity",
          "text": "She tested tariff jokes on someone. That someone was probably you in a mirror.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Tradecraft",
          "text": "Funding question is cover-compatible and intel-adjacent. Good bait.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "briefing.romance_protocol",
      "speaker": "wren_halden",
      "text": "Manners, then \u2014 clinical. Do not correct her if she is wrong about weather; you are not a sensor array. Ask about her work before you invent charm. If silence arrives, inhabit it; do not fill it with freight anecdotes. And Cassian: she can smell a flowchart. If you follow one, she will file you under handled and move on to someone with a pulse.",
      "tags": [
        "briefing",
        "comedy",
        "romance_advice"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "op": "set_flag",
          "flag": "romance_protocol_received",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "briefing.romance.take_notes",
          "text": "Work first. Silence allowed. No flowchart.",
          "intent": "comply",
          "next": "briefing.romance_more",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "set_flag",
              "flag": "following_romance_protocol",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "briefing.romance.refuse",
          "text": "I'm not running a courtship script on her.",
          "intent": "pushback",
          "next": "briefing.romance_more",
          "effects": [
            {
              "op": "set_flag",
              "flag": "following_romance_protocol",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "op": "rel",
              "char": "wren_halden",
              "respect": -1,
              "trust": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "next": null,
      "faculty_interjections": [
        {
          "faculty": "Empathy",
          "text": "She is a person with a brief. Meet the brief, not the protocol.",
          "weight": 2
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Insecurity",
          "text": "She will file you. Everyone files you.",
          "weight": 1
        },
        {
          "faculty": "Improvisation",
          "text": "Burn the script. Risk looking alive.",
          "weight": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
